          "worked": "Express the numbers in quarters and compare their positions on the number line:\n$$-\\frac{12}{4}<-\\frac{7}{4}<-\\frac{6}{4}<\\frac{3}{4}<\\frac{8}{4}<\\frac{11}{4}.$$\nTherefore the increasing order is\n$$-3,\\ -1\\frac{3}{4},\\ -1\\frac{1}{2},\\ \\frac{3}{4},\\ 2,\\ 2\\frac{3}{4}.$$",
